### closure_wrap

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl closure_wrap forall t. (x : rust.box t) : closure t =\n    // Rust: a Box<dyn Fn> isn't Clone, so it goes to the macro as is (a join point's argument is cloned)\n    inl x = if is_rust () then x else join x\n    !\\($'\"wasm_bindgen::closure::Closure::wrap(!x)\"')","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl closure_wrap forall t. (x : rust.box t) : closure t =
      // Rust: a Box<dyn Fn> isn't Clone, so it goes to the macro as is (a join point's argument is cloned)
      inl x = if is_rust () then x else join x
      !\($'"wasm_bindgen::closure::Closure::wrap(!x)"')
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### closure_forget

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl closure_forget forall t. (closure : closure t) =\n    !\\($'\"!closure.forget()\"') : ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl closure_forget forall t. (closure : closure t) =
      !\($'"!closure.forget()"') : ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

